## Database Models

### User
- `user_id` (Primary Key)
- `name`, `email`, `password_hash`, `phone`
- `location_lat`, `location_long`
- `roles` (Many-to-Many with Role)
- `created_at`

### Role
- `role_id` (Primary Key)
- `role_name` (donor/receiver/admin)

### FoodItem
- `food_id` (Primary Key)
- `name`, `quantity`, `status`
- `donor_id` (Foreign Key → User)
- `expiry_date`, `created_at`

### Request
- `request_id` (Primary Key)
- `quantity`, `urgency_level`, `status`
- `receiver_id` (Foreign Key → User)
- `deadline`, `created_at`

### Transaction
- `txn_id` (Primary Key)
- `donor_id`, `receiver_id` (Foreign Keys)
- `status`, `created_at`, `completed_at`

### Match
- `match_id` (Primary Key)
- `food_id`, `request_id` (Foreign Keys)
- `status`, `created_at`

## API Endpoints

### Authentication (`/auth`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| POST | `/auth/register` | Register new user | No |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login and get JWT | No |
| POST | `/auth/logout` | Logout | Yes |
| GET | `/auth/debug-token` | Validate JWT token | Yes |

**Register Request:**
```json
{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "location_lat": 40.7128,
  "location_long": -74.0060,
  "roles": ["donor"]
}
```

**Login Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "access_token": "eyJ0eXAi...",
  "refresh_token": "eyJ0eXAi...",
  "user_id": 1,
  "roles": ["donor"]
}
```

### Food Management (`/food`, `/api/food`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/food/all` | List available foods | Yes |
| POST | `/food` | Create food listing | Yes (Donor) |
| GET | `/food/my/:userId` | Get user's foods | Yes |
| PUT | `/food/:foodId` | Update food | Yes (Owner) |
| DELETE | `/food/:foodId` | Delete food | Yes (Owner) |
| GET | `/food/nearby` | Find nearby foods | Yes |
| POST | `/api/food/:foodId/images` | Upload image | Yes |

**Create Food Request**
```json
{
  "name": "Fresh Vegetables",
  "quantity": 10.5,
  "expiry_date": "2025-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "donor_id": 1
}
```

### Requests (`/requests`, `/food/requests`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/requests/all` | List requests | Yes (Donor/Receiver) |
| POST | `/requests` | Create request | Yes (Receiver) |
| GET | `/requests/my/:userId` | User's requests | Yes |
| PUT | `/requests/:requestId` | Update request | Yes (Owner) |
| DELETE | `/requests/:requestId` | Delete request | Yes (Owner) |
| GET | `/food/requests/nearby` | Nearby requests | Yes (Donor) |

### Transactions (`/transactions`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| POST | `/transactions` | Create transaction | Yes |
| GET | `/transactions/user/:userId` | User transactions | Yes |
| PUT | `/transactions/:txnId/status` | Update status | Yes |
| POST | `/transactions/:txnId/complete` | Mark complete | Yes |

### Admin Dashboard (`/api/admin`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/api/admin/dashboard/summary` | System metrics | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/users` | List users (paginated) | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/users/:userId` | User details | Admin |
| PUT | `/api/admin/users/:userId/role` | Update roles | Admin |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/users/:userId` | Deactivate user | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/foods` | List foods (paginated) | Admin |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/foods/:foodId` | Delete food | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/requests` | List requests (paginated) | Admin |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/requests/:requestId` | Delete request | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/transactions` | List transactions | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/statistics/food-types` | Food stats | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/statistics/daily-activity` | Activity timeline | Admin |
| GET | `/api/admin/health` | System health | Admin |

### Analytics (`/api/analytics`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/api/analytics/summary` | User analytics | Yes |
| GET | `/api/analytics/global-summary` | Platform stats | No |

### Route Optimization (`/api/routes`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| POST | `/api/routes/optimize` | Calculate route | Yes |
| GET | `/api/routes/:userId` | Get user routes | Yes |

**Optimize Route Request:**
```json
{
  "start_location": {"lat": 40.7128, "long": -74.0060},
  "destinations": [
    {"lat": 40.7580, "long": -73.9855},
    {"lat": 40.7489, "long": -73.9680}
  ]
}
```

### MongoDB Features (`/api/mongodb`, `/logs`, `/feedback`)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|--------|----------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/api/mongodb/notifications` | Get notifications | Yes |
| POST | `/api/mongodb/notifications/:id/read` | Mark read | Yes |
| GET | `/logs/activities` | Activity feed | Yes |
| POST | `/feedback` | Submit feedback | Yes |
| GET | `/feedback` | Get feedback | Yes |

## Authentication & Authorization

### JWT Token Structure
```json
{
  "sub": "14",  // User ID
  "roles": ["donor", "admin"],
  "exp": 1735123456,
  "iat": 1735121656
}
```

### Protected Routes
Add JWT token to request headers:
```
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>
```

### Role-Based Access Control
Decorators for route protection:
```python
from flask_jwt_extended import jwt_required, get_jwt_identity

@app.route('/protected')
@jwt_required()
def protected():
    user_id = get_jwt_identity()
    return {"user_id": user_id}
```

**Admin-only Routes:**
```python
from backend.routes.admin_routes import admin_required

@app.route('/admin/data')
@admin_required
def admin_data():
    return {"data": "sensitive"}
```

## Socket.IO Events

### Client → Server
| Event | Data | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `connect` | `{token: "jwt"}` | Authenticate connection |
| `disconnect` | - | Client disconnect |

### Server → Client
| Event | Data | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `notification` | `{message, type, data}` | New notification |
| `match_found` | `{match_id, details}` | Food-request match |
| `status_update` | `{txn_id, status}` | Transaction update |

**Connection Example**
```python
# Backend
from extensions import socketio

@socketio.on('connect')
def handle_connect():
    user_id = get_jwt_identity()
    emit('connected', {'user_id': user_id})
```

